752010_5438167053200796736_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c3JVGc44v84Q7kNvwH1mOHp&_nc_oc=Adrc2ETCEtna1dq54XiutVq3N8oK4ameM6T-DLWWVdaVyTftxTFMUJODFSJpnX6RpLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9DGyqABvdjKBJl4PzI7-2VD2rg3e2xaZYpUnRtSaW5uQ&oe=6A257199"}, {"file_name": "image1.png", "id": "1200243745574174", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593828091_1200243748907507_3022409620308799602_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-mM49AjdsqEQ7kNvwEetfd8&_nc_oc=Adqfhkt10TR9v8fjRwEaWe7bbMZqjJKroCDA4UhlRSxyDT1u4bOdWfHw69mqChbDgtc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Z-MA_qkjRJDa_ciXHOnFdwNWRS6iN8CfTWxb3UUuhXw&oe=6A2574CF"}, {"file_name": "Image2.png", "id": "1068916002027943", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820923_1068916008694609_2171202733350884856_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=drNqIMkKLiQQ7kNvwGxTFmp&_nc_oc=AdrSnNYKBBZKcQaJmajIrKIz915yz4luJXzDX3KXJ-FRDkRlEsDYAdfr4mz8Ci4-eaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Hu8ZMg9VWNtCZn8gdHx5hOgRaAUbNGiaiN8t7f-soNw&oe=6A2573CD"}, {"file_name": "Image4.png", "id": "1188972286283069", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1188972289616402_6991489702767110484_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yWQr0XYviRUQ7kNvwHcxlQM&_nc_oc=AdpTjBS6TmLjUTqLVh6YgklW8zNVDNbpBw5EILPrRlgm_RjFQ6wv6sBXUc7li4p78Jw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_OuhFhotczFF4nLkRbEHP_fUzRpyKoioF4NtOk_BBXUQ&oe=6A258562"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "1364261728327989", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821568_1364261731661322_5304120469068471427_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MKb0JRq57S4Q7kNvwFHqptX&_nc_oc=Adqmgwqo5TRiNqGIBdxjFkp7S1YUwBRGdQQXnvKpL0evbL-OfS5AvRTnNFtGwVhgSwU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8iH_7_xiYVSgSu16KIQObhwllfg1agzs4gsSdVQiMxug&oe=6A25984C"}, "display_name": "Twisted Dark", "keywords": ["comic", "book", "horror", "experience", "story"], "long_description": "Enter Twisted Dark, an immersive VR comic reading experience built around one core promise: a huge amount of story content delivered inside interactive 3D worlds.\n\nRead the complete 8-volume Twisted Dark collection in Twisted Mode. Each volume is presented in a custom 3D scene designed to pull you into the atmosphere of the book. Explore and interact with Twisted Objects hidden throughout the environment. Find them to trigger a chilling reveal: the scene \u201cbreaks,\u201d shifting into its creepy Twisted version.\n\nPrefer a linear narrative? Switch to Story Mode, a curated experience with three additional books, the stories of Amy, Mike, and Candice presented in chronological order for a clearer, character-driven journey through the Twisted Dark universe.\n\nWant to stay grounded in your space? Use Passthrough Mode and bring Twisted Dark into your real environment while you read.\n\nFeatures\n\nAll 8 Twisted Dark volumes included (Twisted Mode)\n\nUnique 3D scene per volume with special interactions\n\nTwisted Objects to discover uncover the unsettling Twisted version of each scene on the Twisted Mode\n\nStory Mode with 3 extra books: Amy, Mike, and Candice in chronological order\n\nPassthrough Mode for reading in your real space\n\nDesigned for immersive, comfortable comic reading in VR\n\nIf you want an atmospheric, content-rich experience that blends reading with exploration and discovery, Twisted Dark delivers the definitive way to enter the story.", "short_description": "Every volume hides something. Read all 8 Twisted Dark books in custom made environments from the stories, uncover Twisted Objects, and watch the world shift into its misterious Twisted version."}]}, "developer_name": "OceanRoot Productions", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "ht